Z||000004||mrfiero||12-08-2000||01:30 AM||||The "real" Pace Car indeed had tan interior.....the car that actually paced the race.  The driver, John Calles (sp?) preferred the tan to the gray so he got his wish.<P>Also notice the position of the nose emblem.  It is flush with the hood line......as far as I know this was the only Pace Car to have this done.  I have seen one of the backup cars (there were a total of 3 prepped for the race) and the emblem was in the stock location (and had gray interior).    <P><p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 12-08-2000).]||||reg||1
